 ("card", "Restructuring", "Helping companies that are in financial trouble fix their debt, sometimes in bankruptcy.", "Advisory"),
 ("h2", "Coverage groups vs. product groups"),
 ("p", "Banks split teams two ways. <b>Coverage groups</b> focus on an industry, like healthcare, technology or energy. <b>Product groups</b> focus on a type of deal, like M&amp;A, leveraged finance or restructuring. They work together on deals."),
